WEBVTT

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:04.850
Good morning, Sophie!

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.940
Good morning, Sister.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.350
Okay, let's get you ready for the day.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.900
Sophie, Sophie.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.830
Lovely Sophie, so adorable.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:23.080
Sophie, romantic Sophie, Sophie!

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.800
Today we'll go with Holic Trick's newest, the Classic Trump Top!

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:46.060
You look fabulous, Sophie!

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:49.980
There! Your Farewell to Summer Make Up is cosmic ready.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.190
Let's just finish things up with some Red Flash.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.820
All switched on?

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:01.080
Yes. Good day, Sister dear.

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:39.010
Whaaat?

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:43.470
We got in the same PriPara TV variety show as Sophie?

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:46.680
That's amazing! This is the best! I can't believe it!

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.820
All thanks to <i>me</i>-kuma!

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:50.940
I guess you can be useful sometimes-pri.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:53.460
Whaddya mean <i>sometimes</i>-kuma?

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:58.360
Anyway, this is the big break you've been waiting for, so don't mess it up-kuma!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.590
Capisce!

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:04.330
So, about tomorrow's variety show-usa...

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.410
You really going to be okay-usa, Sophie?

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:11.910
You've been going into fancy mode a lot lately-usa...

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.290
You really think so?

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:17.550
You'll be a lot closer to the fans than usual-usa!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:21.030
So I want you to really focus on keeping it together-usa!

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:24.630
You absolutely must not let anyone see Fancy Mode-usa!

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:26.010
If anyone saw...

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.870
All the popularity we've built up so far...

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:32.450
My career—I mean, all the work we've done!

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:37.370
The expectations of your dear sister Cosmo and the Royal Guard would all be let down-usa!

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.370
Do you get it, Sophie?

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:40.990
Yes.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.320
And you guys make sure you look after her-usa!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.470
You can count on us!

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:45.200
Chanko!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:51.290
Excellent, excellent! A carrot juice toast for Sophie's bright future! Glug-glug!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:58.000
Actually, someone saw the normal me recently, and they didn't hate me or anything.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.210
Hmm, what was that-usa?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:07.680
Anyway, you're a true genius, Sophie. So I want you to focus on your idol career and nothing else-usa!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:15.400
<i>W-Wow! So pretty!</i>

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.280
Ta-dah-kuma!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.350
It's finally time for the variety show!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:31.450
"Goodbye to Summer Live! Exciting Idol Meeting!"-kuma!

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:34.160
All manner of quizzes and games of skill await-kuma!

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.920
The winning pair will—oh, dear me!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.650
They'll be the only ones to perform on stage today-kuma!

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.880
Puff puff! Yahoo! Puff puff!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:44.470
But only if we win, huh?

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.930
It's Sophie!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:48.390
Kuma!

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:49.890
Usa!

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.580
Oh, you're here too, Lala?

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.190
Y-Yes!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:55.890
And this is Mireille!

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.490
H-Hello! I'm Mireille-pri!

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:00.150
She's my teammate!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.740
I see. Mireille.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:03.860
Nice to meet you-pri!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:06.070
I've always been a huge fan-pri!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:09.160
Now then, it's time for the raffle to decide on pairs!

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.190
What? Mireille and I aren't pairing up?

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.620
Lottery? I wasn't aware-pri.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:18.080
I'm sure it was explained when you signed up.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:19.190
Uh...

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:20.920
Kuma, you...

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.460
Oh dear. How could they fail to inform me of something so important?

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.940
You didn't even ask!

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:26.840
Hhm, the sun sure is bright today.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.870
What's with the shades? You think you look cool-pri?

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:31.750
What's with the fight?

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.060
Hurry up already.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.580
I've never teamed up with anyone but Mireille before.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:43.860
I got pink!

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.820
I'm with Sophie?

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.200
Lala's with Sophie?

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.040
I'm paired with Sophie?

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.000
Hi again.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.710
Uh, y-yeah! Capisce!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.180
Owie!

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:02.430
<i>Not </i>capisce.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:04.010
Calm down-pri.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:08.820
Dang it! We're only here because declining the invitation would've been awkward.

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.140
And then we get saddled with a hopeless pair-up like this-usa!

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:16.480
How rude-kuma! Lala is a Good Student rank idol with downright unbelievable potential-kuma!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.560
Better watch out or she's gonna swallow you whole-kuma!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.040
Ha! I've never heard a less convincing boast!

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.780
Do try to enjoy looking pathetic next to Sophie.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.530
Nanami from Pink Actress! Nice to meet you-pri!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.660
You guys have been doing great lately-pri!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:36.120
Kyupikon! You too, Mireille! Kyupikon!

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.220
Not as planned, but this might just work out-pri!

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:44.650
Think of it like this: The overall chance for either me or Lala getting to sing is higher now!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:45.960
Oh, I get it!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:47.650
So let's both aim for the top!

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:48.610
No slacking off-kuma!

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.590
Let's go all out, Lala!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:57.560
Goodbye to the Summer Live!! Exciting Idol Meeting!!

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:01.190
Soon, after going through elimination after elimination,

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:06.900
our remaining eight idols will compete in this much-anticipated annual event!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:10.570
Keep that victory show in your mind, contestants!

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:15.410
And our first event: Puzzling Riddle Quiz Time!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:19.910
Eh, I'm no good at riddles. What about you, Sophie?

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.980
<i>As always, she's keeping her cool.</i>

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:26.380
<i>She's a genius, so I bet this will be a breeze.</i>

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.920
<i>But gosh, she sure looks a lot like our pickle plum pizza customer.</i>

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.880
<i>I kinda wanna tell Sophie about her!</i>

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.750
Riddles... You think Sophie's going to be okay-chanko?

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.930
A pickled plum takes care of her physical performance, but...

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:43.880
<i>But she's still totally useless on the inside—
I mean, stuck in Fancy Mode-usa.</i>

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:47.780
<i>But it's fine-usa! So far it's always been like:</i>

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:51.700
<i>I haven't been all that good, though...</i>

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.660
<i>So cool!</i>

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.410
The audience will take anything she does as her just being "cool".

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.580
No worries-usa.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:07:59.610
Oh yeah.

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:00.250
Chanko.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:11.920
Here we go. First Question.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:16.260
An eagle is not eager to seek out the company of others,

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:16.490
But finches don't flinch from large groups.

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:18.700
Finches don't flinch from large groups.

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:18.740
But finches don't flinch from large groups.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:18.990
What bird, then, has no luck waking up before noon?

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.180
What bird has no luck waking up before noon?

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.350
Umm, errr...

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.070
I have no idea, but I pressed it anyway!

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.540
Do you get it, Sophie?

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.190
A cagebird.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:30.820
Is that it?

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:35.360
So cool!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.710
Sooo cool!

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:38.950
Just as usual.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.080
Good news-chanko.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.480
I'm afraid that's a wrong answer.

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:45.330
Nevertheless, a fast response from Lala.

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:48.790
Oh, "no <i>luck</i>" so how about "duck"-pri?

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:49.570
What bird has no luck waking up before noon?

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:49.860
Oh, "no <i>luck</i>" so how about "duck"-pri?

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.510
Duck
No luck

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:54.640
Kyupikon! You're amazing, Mireille!

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:55.380
Pri!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:55.860
Question #2

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.650
On to the next question.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.810
7+6÷7+7×7-7 equals?

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.600
These are hard.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.570
50-pri!

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.790
Wow, you did it again! Kyupikon!

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:09.570
Pri pri!

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.490
That wasn't really a riddle, was it?

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.870
On to the next question.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:15.610
Here we go.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:21.580
Question 3: What species of frog has the largest tadpole on Earth?

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:22.520
The Shrinking Frog-pri!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.500
I wanna sing already.

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:26.080
The Shrinking frog is a species of frog that lives in South America,

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.460
So do I! So let's do our best to win!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.310
and they're actually larger as tadpoles than as adult frogs.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:34.360
Do our best? I've never really tried that before...

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.730
Next up is our silhouette quiz!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.350
What is this?

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.120
Uh... Huh?

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:43.260
Kyupikon?

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:44.810
Kyupikon...

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:49.520
A Kishu honey-pickled plum.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.480
Correct.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:53.750
All right!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.320
Keep it up-chanko!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.040
Wow! That's amazing, Sophie!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.280
That was some amazing spotting.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.280
Let's move on then:

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:04.200
What's this one?

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:07.310
A Kishu bonito pickled plum.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:08.670
Correct.

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:10.750
And this one?

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.750
Kishu's 3-year specialty, extra rich plum pickle.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.470
Splendid! Another correct answer!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:20.930
Wonderful! You're on fire, Lady Sophie!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.120
Lala hasn't got even one right-kuma...

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.080
Don't even expect anything.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:29.910
It really is shameful to have such a useless idol paired up with my Sophie.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.310
What? Hogwash-kuma!

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.110
I know Lala can do it if she tries!

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:37.850
What's with all of them being pickled plums anyway-pri?

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:38.570
Kyupikon?

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:42.490
Let us move on to the great idol athletic meet.

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:47.710
Now we're getting into real variety show territory!

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:51.290
Our third event is the three-legged bread-eating race!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.670
Then our contestants must crawl their way under the net to a game of whack-a-frog before the goal!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.210
Hm? Bread-eating race?

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.920
Go get 'em, Mireille and Lala!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:01.890
This is my specialty! Let's do our best, Sophie!

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:02.840
Get set,

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:04.850
H-Hey! No one told me-usa—

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.430
...and go!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.930
Let's go!

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:09.360
Don't forget us!

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.110
Pri!

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:11.370
Kyupikon!

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.270
Hey Nanami, can't you go any faster-pri?

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:14.170
Kyupikon!

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.070
We're here too!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:16.700
This is bad...

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:17.230
Chanko!

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:23.260
Lady Sophie returns to Fancy Mode upon tasting anything sweet!

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.660
This is... sweet...

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:30.620
Sugar

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:33.790
I have to... Pshu...

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:35.750
Pshu?

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.540
What?

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:52.410
What happened?

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:52.980
I'm scared!

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:54.940
A blackout, huh?

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.200
Had these all the time back in my day-kuma.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.690
Just hafta sit tight till the power comes back-kuma. Gulp.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:01.650
What? What's going on?

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.120
Please keep calm, everyone!

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:05.620
We will have the situation under control as soon as possible!

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:09.120
So that's what it was.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:13.250
You were the pickled plum pizza person all along.

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.210
That's right.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:22.870
I need Red Flash to function any better than this.

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:24.180
You're disappointed, right?

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.640
What? I'm just a bit surprised, not disappointed.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.620
I like both Sophies.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:33.740
I always thought the pickled plum pizza person was pretty cute.

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:35.740
And Sophie is still as cool as ever!

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:38.940
And both are just as much the real Sophie as the other, right?

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.700
Real me?

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:45.630
I've actually always been pretty physically weak.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.970
<i>Sophie! Sophie?</i>

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:52.080
<i>Again with the dancing, Sophie?</i>

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:55.370
<i>Because I can hear music, Sister!</i>

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:59.340
<i>And I can't just sit still when I do!</i>

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:04.940
<i>Sophie, do keep your weak constitution in mind.</i>

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:09.810
<i>If you start dancing first thing in the morning, you won't have any strength left for later.</i>

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:13.270
<i>It's fine. I've got Red Flash.</i>

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:16.720
<i>You really are a strange one, getting so perked up with just pickled plums.</i>

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:19.980
<i>So isn't it okay to dance, Sister?</i>

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:24.580
<i>And our next contestant is still in elementary school!</i>

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:28.200
<i>She has been dreaming of becoming idol since a very young age!</i>

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:31.110
<i>Will she realize that dream today?</i>

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:33.860
<i>Please welcome Houjou Sophie on stage!</i>

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.370
<i>Sister, Red Flash.</i>

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:39.880
<i>Do your best out there, Sophie.</i>

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:46.850
<i>S-S-S-Soooooouur!</i>

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:51.630
<i>Never underestimate the power of pickled plums...</i>

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:54.340
<i>I'll go sing now!</i>

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:55.320
<i>Take care.</i>

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.460
<i>Wow! Amazing!</i>

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:00.880
<i>She's so little!</i>

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:02.590
<i>She's so good!</i>

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:04.000
<i>Her dancing is perfect!</i>

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.510
<i>Is she really only eight?</i>

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:06.180
<i>Crazy!</i>

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.130
<i>So cute!</i>

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:09.700
<i>It's like she was born to sing!</i>

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:12.160
<i>Sophie, you're so cute!</i>

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.520
<i>Wonderful! This was a wonderful surprise!</i>

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:19.120
<i>We have just witnessed the youngest person to make a successful PriPara debut show!</i>

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:22.170
<i>That was really nice Sophie! You did really great!</i>

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.630
<i>Pshu...</i>

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.930
<i>This girl is a genius-usa!</i>

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:31.510
<i>Simply wonderful! She caught everyone's hearts in an instant!</i>

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:37.730
<i>Allow me to act as her manager,
and she'll be a top idol in no time-usa!</i>

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:44.190
<i>Well, that performance was something of a fluke thanks to a pickled plum she had...</i>

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:47.650
<i>We'll just always have her plummed up to hide her uselessn—</i>

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:54.890
<i>I mean, to make sure to hide this...
Fancy Mode from the audience-usa!</i>

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:57.280
I see...

00:14:57.280 --> 00:15:00.120
But I don't really think you need to hide it.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:03.340
We'll be in first place when the power comes back-pri!

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:07.710
Hurry up! Kyupikon, Kyupikon!

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.140
Should we give up the race?

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:21.810
You say you don't mind, but I know everyone only likes my stage personality.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.520
Huh? You really think so?

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:27.780
I think everyone would like you like this too.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:28.650
Like?

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:30.690
See!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.860
